      <h2 class="text-[32px] sm:text-[36px] leading-[42px] sm:leading-[44px] font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-foreground mb-6" data-ps="src/components/about-us/AboutTeam.astro:2zesac">
        A History of M&amp;G Security
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[16px] leading-[24px] text-muted-foreground mt-6" data-ps="src/components/about-us/AboutTeam.astro:gq6ru1">
        M&amp;G Security was founded in <strong class="text-foreground">1997</strong> by former <strong class="text-foreground">Reading Police Sergeant Mark N. Pellicciotti</strong> and retired <strong class="text-foreground">Pennsylvania State Trooper Anthony DiGuglielmo</strong>.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[16px] leading-[24px] text-muted-foreground mt-4" data-ps="src/components/about-us/AboutTeam.astro:gq6ru2">
        Our staff consists of active and retired law enforcement personnel with over <span class="text-primary font-bold" data-ps="src/components/about-us/AboutTeam.astro:uza0h9">60 years of combined law enforcement experience</span>. We bring the discipline, training, and professionalism of police work to every security assignment.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[16px] leading-[24px] text-muted-foreground/80 mt-4" data-ps="src/components/about-us/AboutTeam.astro:gq6ru3">
        From the Santander Arena to local construction sites, high school proms to corporate offices, we have protected the people and properties of Berks County with integrity and professionalism for over 27 years.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-border" data-ps="src/components/about-us/AboutTeam.astro:ewsfb">
        <div data-ps="src/components/about-us/AboutTeam.astro:ewsfa">
          <p class="text-primary text-[24px] font-bold" data-ps="src/components/about-us/AboutTeam.astro:gq6ru4">1997</p>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold" data-ps="src/components/about-us/AboutTeam.astro:gq6ru5">Year Founded</p>
        </div>
        <div data-ps="src/components/about-us/AboutTeam.astro:ewsf9">
          <p class="text-primary text-[24px] font-bold" data-ps="src/components/about-us/AboutTeam.astro:gq6ru6">60+</p>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold" data-ps="src/components/about-us/AboutTeam.astro:gq6ru7">Years LEO Exp.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-ps="src/components/about-us/AboutTeam.astro:ewsf8">
          <p class="text-primary text-[24px] font-bold" data-ps="src/components/about-us/AboutTeam.astro:gq6ru8">27+</p>
